/**
 * Content model for the 40-page tool cluster.
 *
 * Every route here gets its own formula, its own worked example and its own
 * FAQ. The previous build rendered all 40 pages from one shared template,
 * which made them near-identical to a crawler even though their titles
 * differed. Distinctness is the point of this file.
 *
 * House rules for the fields below:
 *   title  - <= 60 chars, no word repeated back to back, no repeated year
 *   desc   - <= 155 chars
 *   h1     - the natural search phrase, brand suffix omitted
 *   table  - worked examples with the assumptions stated in `assumptions`
 *   faqs   - 2+ real questions, answerable without guessing
 *
 * Numeric tables are illustrative worked examples, not quotes. Where a figure
 * depends on a rate that changes (tax bands, statutory minimums, subscription
 * prices) the `caveat` field says so and points at the authoritative source.
 */

